# Messages for annals-graph's errors. Each id is an error's code; the
# variables are its args. Messages are lowercase fragments, like the English
# Display, so they read well inside another message.

annals-graph-bad-namespace = bad tag "{ $text }": a namespace is lowercase letters, digits, _ and -
annals-graph-bad-name = bad tag "{ $text }": a name is lowercase letters, digits, _ and -
annals-graph-bad-symbol = bad tag "{ $text }": a symbol is lowercase letters, digits, _ and -
annals-graph-empty-namespace = bad tag "{ $text }": an empty namespace: leave out the colon, or name it
